<title>USA: USDA job announcements to come soon - Sec'y Glickman.</title>
<headline>USDA job announcements to come soon - Sec'y Glickman.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Secretary Dan Glickman said he believed announcements would be made in the next week or two to fill vacant high-level posts at his department.</p>
<p>&quot;I'm confident on a couple of the major ones, announcements will be made in a week or two,&quot; Glickman told farm broadcasters.</p>
<p>Appointment of a new Farm Service Administration chief&quot;hopefully...will be in the next week,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Four undersecretary posts were vacant at USDA, including the slot for running the farm program.</p>
</text>
